      "en": "Nicodemus said to him, “How can a man be born when he is old? Can he enter a second time into his mother’s womb and be born?”",
      "ko": "니고데모가 가로되 사람이 늙으면 어떻게 날 수 있삽나이까 두번째 모태에 들어갔다가 날 수 있삽나이까",
      "source_text_hash": "93052427c9fee9ffa557e92338db0a3f7b61e8516da0e23df861a6bc3768767b",
