      "en": "For God so loved the world, that he gave his only bornSon, that whoever believes in him should not perish, but have eternal life.",
      "ko": "하나님이 세상을 이처럼 사랑하사 독생자를 주셨으니 이는 저를 믿는 자마다 멸망치 않고 영생을 얻게 하려 하심이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "11247f72e65b7cd0229b12a5a962a3c0042a8839ae037bf7597f9ff9dd6cf1ac",
      "translation_text_hash": "f171a68f79e967d55d421a7ad781181c0fe1c922b18f28a55769ffa57394d467",
